@startuml
title FAC10/week4-jajascript — Nobel Laureates Autocomplete Web App

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

node "Web Browser\n(Search UI)" as Browser

node "Heroku Dyno\n(Node.js Runtime)" as Dyno {
  package "Application (CommonJS)" as App {
    [HTTP Router] as Router

    package "Request Handlers" as Handlers {
      [Home Page Handler] as Home
      [Static File Server\n+ Content-Type Mapper] as StaticSrv
      [Not-Found Handler (404)] as NotFound
    }

    package "Search / Autocomplete" as SearchPkg {
      [Autocomplete Engine] as Auto
      [Data Access] as DataAccess
    }
  }

  folder "public/\n(HTML, CSS, JS, JPG, ICO)" as Public
  database "Laureate Data\n(local JSON)" as DataJSON
}

' Client requests to server
Browser --> Router : HTTP GET /\nHTTP GET /...search...\nHTTP GET /assets...

' Routing responsibilities
Router --> Home : route "/" (FR-003)
Router --> Auto : URL contains "search" (FR-004, C-004)
Router --> StaticSrv : other requests (FR-005)

' Home & static file handling
Home --> Public : read index.html
StaticSrv --> Public : read asset by path (C-002, C-003)
Home --> NotFound : on file read failure (FR-007)
StaticSrv --> NotFound : on file read failure (FR-007)

' Search/autocomplete flow
Auto --> DataAccess : request laureate names (FR-008)
DataAccess --> DataJSON : read local JSON (A-002, DR-002)
Auto --> Router : array of names (prefix-match, <=10) (FR-002, FR-009)

' Responses back to client
Router --> Browser : HTML | CSS | JS | JPG | ICO | JSON (FR-006, NFR-002)

note right of Router
Plain substring routing logic (C-004):
- if url == "/" -> Home
- else if "search" in url -> Autocomplete
- else -> Static file server
end note

note right of StaticSrv
Content-Type mapping (FR-006, NFR-002):
- html → text/html
- css  → text/css
- js   → application/javascript
- jpg  → image/jpg
- ico  → image/x-icon
end note

note bottom of Dyno
Startup via Node.js start script; deploy target: Heroku
(A-004, NFR-004; C-001)
end note

rectangle "Automated Tests" as Tests
Tests ..> Auto : FR-002, FR-009
Tests ..> DataAccess : FR-008
Tests ..> Router : FR-004, FR-005
Tests ..> StaticSrv : FR-006, FR-007
Tests ..> Home : FR-003

@enduml
